<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Glory! Glory! Live by Christ today!</l><l>Glory! Walk in Spirit and obey!</l><l>Failure turns to vict’ry,</l><l>Sighing turns to song!</l><l>Glory! Glory! Live by Christ today!</l></lg>
</div>
